# Provider Patterns

Required order: CurrencyProvider -> WalletProvider -> ScreenProvider.
Changing order can break initialization, navigation, and timeout behavior.

- WalletProvider: single LibQC instance (useRef), wallet/account/balance state, context methods
- CurrencyProvider: selected currency + persistence
- ScreenProvider: active screen + transition + hydration + session timeout

Each provider has paired useX hook that throws outside provider context.

Target: setupValueProvider<T>() / setupStateProvider<T>() factory pattern.
CurrencyProvider is simplest migration candidate. Do not migrate without dedicated ticket.
